# Calendar first day of week (FDW)

- General setting **`general.fdw`**: `"monday"` | `"sunday"` (default **Monday**). Read **`useAppParameters().fdw`** (or API `general.fdw`); validate with **`isGeneralFdwId`** from `frontend/src/utils/firstDayOfWeekPreference.ts`.
- **PrimeReact `Calendar`**: Do not hardcode week start per screen. **`PrimeLocaleSync`** calls `addLocale` with **`firstDayOfWeek`** from **`primeFirstDayOfWeekFromFdw(fdw)`** (0 = Sunday, 1 = Monday). Keep `registerPrimeLocales.ts` aligned: avoid duplicating conflicting `firstDayOfWeek` there.
- **Other custom month/week grids**: Reuse the same **`primeFirstDayOfWeekFromFdw(fdw)`** offset logic (0 = Sunday, 1 = Monday) so headers and cells stay in sync with FDW.
